Remember this, which I tell you before, that you may lay it to heart,
and receive that which is to follow.
6. Behold, verily I say unto you, for this cause I have sent you—that
you might be obedient, and that your hearts might be prepared to bear
testimony of the things which are to come;
7. And also that you might be honored in laying the foundation, and in
bearing record of the land upon which the Zion of God shall stand;
8. And also that a feast of fat things might be prepared for the poor;
yea, a feast of fat things, of wine on the lees well refined, that the earth may
know that the mouths of the prophets shall not fail;
9. Yea, a supper of the house of the Lord, well prepared, unto which all
nations shall be invited.
10. First, the rich and the learned, the wise and the noble;
